        "text": "Z.ai GLM spans 16 catalog versions, all of which support reasoning, and 12 of the 16 publish open weights, so most of the line can be self hosted while a few remain API only. Context windows run from 65536 to 1048576 tokens, and every version accepts image, text and video input while returning text. The cheapest listed tiers, such as GLM 4.7 Flash at $0.06 input and $0.4 output per million tokens, suit high volume work, while the newest API only releases reach $2.8 input and $8.8 output. Long context and video input point to document, media and agent style tasks. Limits include the narrow 16384 token output on some older versions, and the priciest tiers are costly for bulk use. No benchmark rows are given.",
